赛程、天气预报与观赛指南","summaryZh":"F1西班牙大奖赛在马德里Madring赛道进入周六环节。第二次练习赛中，梅赛德斯车手Kimi Antonelli跑出最快圈速，领先法拉利的Charles Leclerc，Lewis Hamilton位列第三，车手们继续在这条马德里新赛道上积累信心。Racing Bulls的Arvid Lindblad表现抢眼排名第四，但随后发生撞车。","publishedAt":"2026-09-11T20:07:52.582Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-11T17:22:55.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-5.motorsport.com/images/amp/6VyKmB4Y/s6/carlos-sainz-williams.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":167621,"altZh":"F1西班牙大奖赛马德里站：周六赛程、天气预报与观赛指南"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/f1-spanish-gp-at-madring-saturday-schedule-weather-forecast-and-how-to-watch/10854656/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}}]}